# ~/.ssh/config - deployed as a symlink by deploy_configs.py (entry ssh_config
# in personal_credentials/personal_manifest.yaml; personal machines only).
#
# Deliberately machine-neutral: every real Host entry lives in a
# ~/.ssh/config.d/*.conf fragment deployed by whichever overlay manifest owns
# it, so each context's hosts follow that context's clones. Do not add Host
# entries here - put them in the right fragment. A relative Include resolves
# against ~/.ssh (OpenSSH rule, same on Windows OpenSSH), and an Include
# pattern that matches nothing is silently ignored, so this file is safe on
# every platform and on machines with no fragments deployed yet.

Include config.d/*.conf
